 aesthetic.\n\n**Subject:**\nThe central figure is a beautiful young East Asian woman with long, flowing black hair that appears to be caught by the wind, creating dynamic movement as strands sweep across her face and shoulders. Her skin is smooth and porcelain-toned, glowing under bright sunlight. She has large, expressive brown eyes with subtle makeup—softly defined lashes and a hint of shimmer—and full lips painted with a soft pink or nude lipstick. Her gaze is direct and engaging, meeting the viewer’s eye with a calm, serene expression.\n\nShe wears a striking top—a black crop top featuring thin spaghetti straps—that combines classic design with futuristic flair. The most prominent feature is a wide, asymmetrical band made from a highly reflective silver material (possibly metallic vinyl or patent leather) draped over one shoulder like a bold sculptural accent. This element catches the light brilliantly, showing iridescent rainbow reflections along its edges due to the way it's folded and positioned. It adds a strong contrast between the sleek, minimalist black fabric and the glossy, almost sci-fi texture of the silver overlay.\n\n**Setting & Background:**\nThe background suggests she is outdoors on a sunny day near a coastal city street.\n- To her left are blurred urban elements including buildings, traffic lights, and what looks like a sidewalk; these create a shallow depth-of-field effect typical for portraits.\n- Behind her right side, there is a clear view of the ocean—the blue water stretches out beneath a pale sky dotted with faint clouds.\n- A wooden railing or fence can also be seen at the edge of the frame where land meets sea.\n- The lighting is natural daylight, casting sharp highlights on her cheekbones, nose, and the shiny surface of her outfit, while softly shadowing parts of her features and clothing.\n\nOverall, the photograph captures a moment of poised elegance against a backdrop of motion and nature. There's a harmonious blend of organic beauty (her face, hair) and avant-garde fashion (the unique garment), set within an open-air environment that feels both contemporary and timeless. The composition draws focus entirely onto the subject, making her appear radiant yet grounded in her surroundings."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 15, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [5, 14], "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [295.4100036621094, 59.209999084472656], "pos": [1576.2813720703125, 890.685791015625], "widgets_values": ["ae.sft"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "VAELoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [12], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [266.0885009765625, 46], "pos": [2070.742431640625, 937.640625], "inputs": [{"name": "pixels", "link": 13, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "像素"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 14, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "VAEEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEEncode"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [10], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [386.55560302734375, 157.22222900390625], "pos": [1991.72265625, 661.858642578125], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 2, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "CL